message: "If you use the analysis code or author-created exhibits in this repository, please cite this software archive. The accompanying working paper should be cited separately when available."
type: software
license: MIT
title: "Momentum as a Market Regularity: Replication Code and Empirical Exhibits"
authors:
  - family-names: "Lee"
    given-names: "Sungkyu"
    affiliation: "Graduate School of Computing, Yonsei University"
