url: "https://github.com/slackquant80/momentum-market-regularity-replication"
abstract: "Source-pinned Python analyses and author-created empirical exhibits supporting Momentum as a Market Regularity. Includes U.S. stock and industry momentum, international factor diagnostics, and an analysis of published AQR multi-asset time-series momentum factors. Third-party original datasets are not redistributed, and the complete all-input archived-vintage replay has not been independently executed in a clean environment."
